# Terraform (lab-hosts)
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.lock.hcl
crash.log
*.auto.tfvars

# EN: Generated by lab-hosts: real IPs and IDs, never committed / FR : générés par lab-hosts, jamais commités
**/labs/**/inventory*.yml
!**/labs/shared/patterns/inventory.yml
# EN: Module 7 beginner: localhost only, no host data / FR : localhost seulement, aucune donnée d'hôte
!**/module-07-terraform/labs/*/beginner/inventory.yml
# EN: Module 7 intermediate: generated (absolute paths of your machine) / FR : générés (chemins absolus de votre machine)
**/labs/**/*.terraform_state.yml
*.tfplan
**/labs/**/.facts_cache/
**/labs/**/bench-results*.md
**/labs/**/bastion-tunnels.sh

# Ansible
*.retry
.ansible/
**/collections/ansible_collections/
ansible-navigator.log
**/artifacts/*.json
**/context/

# Python / editors
__pycache__/
.venv/
.vscode/
.idea/

# EN: copied into the folder for ansible-navigator / FR : copié pour ansible-navigator
**/labs/*/advanced/site-check.yml

# EN: student work in Module 3 exercises / FR : travail des étudiants (module 3)
**/exercises/my-answers.yml
**/exercises/build-sample/
**/labs/**/build/
**/labs/**/fleet-report.md

# EN: collection build/test output (Module 6) / FR : sorties de build et de tests de collection
**/tests/output/
.pytest_cache/
*.tar.gz
